message: "If you use Berna R5 in your research, please cite the following."
title: "DNA-Kernel Plexus: A Bio-Inspired Architecture for Growing, Self-Correcting Language Models with Proven Zero-Forgetting"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Muhammed
    given-names: Mohammed Kamil
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
    country: IQ
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: "Berna Research License v1.0"
